unavailable-subtitle: [? if jxcat_civic_veto: Our civic-society allies have too much strength within the party to allow for this, as they insist on a party-neutral candidate instead. ?][? if jxcat_erc_balance < 0.65: The balance of power at the moment is too much towards [+ parlament_current_ciu +]. ?][? if jxcat_cdc_relations < 65: We don't have good enough relations with [+ parlament_current_ciu +]. ?][? if party_resources < 1: Not enough resources. ?]
