@erc_refuse
title: Refuse [? if jxsi_formed: another ?][? if not jxsi_formed: another attempt at a ?] common list
subtitle: It's unlikely that this stops [+ parlament_current_ciu +] from trying nonetheless. [? if jxsi_formed and not jxsi_dissolved: Needless to say, this would also mean the dissolution of jxsi. ?]
